levant here), Chicken (42 mins, portion 2 = $12.48), Fried Chicken (14 mins, portion 4 = $27.00).\n\nPortion display: stepper shows current portion number (1,1,2,4) minus/plus enabled/disabled states (portion 1 → minus disabled! nice state demo). Price shown = price for current portion.\n\n**07_Customize**: header back+search. Title copy \"Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience\" — style as two-line heading. Exploded burger image right or center-top (176×240 aspect). Portion stepper (2) + spicy slider (current level — choose Medium? For Cheeseburger consistency with 03 where Mild; customize keeps current level — brief says \"current level\" unspecified; I'll use Mild to match 03? Hmm 03 cheeseburger current level I set Mild; keep Mild here.) Actually let me vary: 03 Mild, 07 Medium? Consistency argues same burger → same level. Keep Mild... visual interest argues Medium mid-thumb. Decide: 03 Mild, 07 Mild. Fine.\n\nAdd-ons: \"Toppings\" horizontal scroll row of 7 addon chips (Tomato added, Cheese added, others default). \"Side options\" row of 5 (Fries added). Total row: \"Total\" + \"$16.48\". CTA Order Now. Frame may scroll vertically → frame can be taller (e.g., 1100) or clipped at 932. I'll make it 932 tall but arrange to fit; tighter. Actually to fit everything: title 2 lines, image 200h, portion+spicy rows, toppings label + row ~ 120, sides label + row 120, total+CTA 100 → ~ 950. Slightly over; make frame 1000 tall? \"Base viewport 430×932 for every frame; Home and Customize may scroll vertically.\" So a taller Customize frame communicates scroll. I'll make Customize 1100 tall to show everything fully. Home fits in 932.\n\n**08_Payment**: header back + search. \"Order summary\" card: rows Order $16.48, Taxes $0.30, Delivery fees $1.50, divider, Total $18.28, estimated delivery time 15–30 mins (row with icon?). \"Payment methods\": two payment rows (Credit card Mastercard 5105 **** **** 0505 selected w/ radio; Debit card Visa 3566 **** **** 05