erent destination) — set on instance.\n\nAlright, fonts: Roboto styles: Regular, Medium, SemiBold? Figma Roboto styles: \"Regular\", \"Medium\", \"Semi Bold\"? In starter text nodes they used style \"SemiBold\" (Roboto SemiBold style name \"SemiBold\" per variation settings shown: style:\"SemiBold\"). And \"Medium\", \"Regular\". Roboto in Figma: styles include Thin, Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold? Actually Roboto has \"Medium\", \"Bold\", \"Black\", \"SemiBold\"? The starter used Roboto SemiBold + Medium + Regular, so those exist. I'll use Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold.\n\nInter \"Semi Bold\" needed only if editing status bar text — I won't edit characters, just fills. Overrides of fills don't need font load. OK.\n\nNow, build order & calls. Each use_figma call max 50000 chars code. I'll write helper-rich code per call, returning summary JSON of created ids.\n\nCall 1: Foundations in workspace:\n- switch page to 2002:2\n- load fonts\n- create DS section frame \"🧩 Design System\" at x=0,y=0 (no autolayout needed; absolute children with manual positions)\n- copy starter Button (1:473) and Text Field (1:495) into DS frame (clone → append)\n- create color style? Could add paint styles: Brand/Red, Brand/Brown, Text/Primary, etc. Nice for consistency but optional; skip to save time? \"visual quality & consistency of your own system\" — styles help. I'll create a few local paint styles quickly: colors. And text styles maybe skip.\n- Build my components:\n  - IconButton set? I'll create components: `IconButton` variants Type=Back|Search|Settings|Menu|Filter — 5 variants, 44×44, white surface r14, icon 22, subtle border. Pressed state? skip.\n  - Chip/Category: 2 variants (Selected, Default), hug contents: pad h20 v10, r999.\n  - Button set: variants Variant=Primary/Secondary × State=Default/Pressed/Disabled (6). Base from starter clone.\n  - Field set: State=Empty/Filled/Focused/Disabled. Base from starter clone, width 380 h 78. (Empty = clone as-is.)\n  - SearchField component: 56h w 262? flexible — set w 300; instances resize.\n  - MenuCard: variants Favourited=False/True, 186×216.\n  - Stepper: single component (minus btn, value \"1\", plus btn). Value editable per instance.\n  - Slider: variants Level=Mild/Medium/Hot, width 280 h ~40 with labels? Keep slider as track only + separate labels in screen. I'll make component include labels Mild/Hot below track ends: 280×52.\n  - AddonChip: variants Added=False/True: 76×96: image tile 56 + label + state icon (plus/check).\n  - PaymentRow: variants Selected=False/True: 380×64.\n  - ProfileRow: 380×48 label + chevron.\n  - Toggle: variant On (48×28). maybe On/Off two variants.\n  - Bubble: variants Agent/Customer, hug.\n  - TabBar: variants Current=Home/Profile/Support/Favourites: 430×88 + add button centered.\n  - SuccessDialog: component for overlay dialog.\n  - ProfileField? Use Field set (Filled/Disabled).\n  - Header/Sub: back+search 430×52 component with IconButton instances.\n\nThat's a lot; distribute across calls 1–3. Then screens in calls 4–8, then prototype wiring call, then screenshots.\n\nHelper functions to define in each call (code is standalone per call — must redefine helpers each call; fine).\n\nKey helpers:\n- findNode(id)\n- makeInst(compOrId, parent, x, y, w?, h?)\n- setIconColor(inst, rgb): traverse descendants; if VECTOR/ELLIPSE/RECTANGLE/BOOLEAN/STAR/LINE/POLYGON: fills=solid; also strokes.\n- txt(font, size, chars, color, opts) create text.\n- rect fill helpers.\n\nAlso must be careful: combining variants requires components on same parent with names \"Prop=Value\" pattern; combineAsVariants(nodes, parent).\n\nFor cloning starter components to workspace page: clone() then wsPage.appendChild? clone stays child of original parent (inside a frame on Components page). Do: const c = comp.clone(); dsFrame.appendChild(c); works across pages? appendChild to a node on another page should reparent — yes, allowed.\n\nInstance creation: comp.createInstance() creates at current page? createInstance adds instance as child of component's parent page? It creates instance at same page as component? Actually `createInstance` creates an instance as a child of the component's parent (same page). Then I appendChild to target parent — cross-page reparent of instance is allowed as long as component is accessible (same file). Should work. Alternative: figma.createNodeFromJSXAsync not available. I'll test in call 1 with small test and return results.\n\nOne risk: createInstance from another page might throw \"cannot be added to another page\"? Instances CAN be on any page. Reparenting instances across pages is allowed.\n\nFor images: clone rects (they're plain rectangles on Media page inside frames). clone then appendChild to my frame — allowed cross-page.\n\nWordmark instance: createInstance of 1:196 (Dark) / 1:204 (White) then reparent.\n\nAvatar: 1:214 instance.\n\nIcons: instances of 1:331 etc.\n\nShell: instances of 49:130 / 49:141 with fill overrides.\n\nNow precise layout math per screen. Screen frames x positions: x = 700 + i*500, y=0. All 932 h except Customize 1100.\n\nLet me define palette consts:\nRED={r:.937,g:.165,b:.224} (#EF2A39)\nBROWN={r:.235,g:.184,b:.184} (#3C2F2F)\nBG={r:.969,g:.961,b:.953} #F7F5F3 warm off-white\nWHITE\nINK={r:.114,g:.098,b:.098} #1D1919 text primary (near-black warm) — or use BROWN as text. I'll use BROWN for headings and INK-ish for body? Simplify: TEXT=BROWN, SUB={r:.545,g:.498,b:.498} #8B7F7F, FAINT={r:.741,g:.702,b:.702} #BDB3B3, LINE={r:.925,g:.906,b:.898} #ECE7E5\nAMBER={r:1,g:.702,b:.098} #FFB31A\nGREEN={r:.18,g:.631,b:.353} #2EA15A\nMILD=#3E9B4F, MED=#FF8A00, HOT=RED\nCARD shadow: y4 blur16 rgba(60,47,47,0.06)\n\nTypography:\n- T1: Roboto Bold 28/34\n- T2: Roboto Bold 22/28\n- T3: SemiBold 18/24\n- B1: Regular 15/22 (body)\n- B2: Regular 13/18\n- CAP: Medium 11/14, letterspacing 0.6 uppercase\n- BTN: SemiBold 18\n\nSpacing: screen pad 20.\n\nNow design each screen in detail.\n\n---\n**01_Splash** (x7